family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">054)478-7014~7016,7018</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">로 문의 바람 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청절차 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① kit포탈 → 원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학사관리 → 학적→ 복학신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력 바람≫ </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">② 복학 확정 여부 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">신청(및 구비서류 제출) 후 4일 이내 확정 여부 확인 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">≪조회 : kit포탈 → 원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학적부 → 학적자료조회 →